34HVVgrzMu5gVA5Ch-kSWcD2xFkR0oQPIVm9lkw&oe=6AFC7A96"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Monkaro", "keywords": ["Monkaro", "Vr", "Monkarovr", "Karo", "Monk"], "long_description": "Welcome to Monkaro \ud83d\udc12\ud83c\udf32\n\nWelcome to Monkaro, an exciting Gorilla Tag fan game where movement, chaos, and fun come together in a mysterious forest!\n\nExplore a rugged forest surrounded by massive rocky cliffs, twisted trees, scattered rocks, and hidden areas. Use your movement skills to climb, jump, run, and swing through the environment while playing tag with friends and other players.\n\n\ud83d\udc12 Tag\n\nJump into the action and experience fast-paced tag gameplay. Chase other players through the forest, escape your opponents, and use the environment to your advantage. Whether you're an experienced player or just starting out, Monkaro is built around having fun and creating memorable moments.\n\n \ud83d\udea8 Reporting System\n\nMonkaro also includes a player reporting system to help keep the community safe and enjoyable. If someone is cheating, harassing players, or breaking the rules, you can report them so the situation can be reviewed.\n\n \ud83d\uded2 Shop\n\nWant to customize your gorilla? Check out the Monkaro Shop, where you can find cosmetics and other items to personalize your experience. More items and customization options can be added as the game continues to grow.\n\n \ud83c\udf32 More to Come\n\nMonkaro is just getting started! We're planning more maps, cosmetics, features, game modes, updates, and surprises in the future. The forest you see today is only the beginning.\n\nRun. Climb. Tag. Explore.\n\nWelcome to Monkaro. \ud83d\udc12\n", "short_description": "Welcome to Monkaro \ud83d\udc12\ud83c\udf32\n\nWelcome to Monkaro, an exciting Gorilla Tag fan game where movement, chaos, and fun come together in a mysterious forest!\n\nExplore a rugged forest surrounded by massive rocky cliffs, twisted trees, scattered rocks, and hidden areas. Use your movement skills to climb, jump, run, and swing through the environment while playing tag with friends and other players.\n\n\ud83d\udc12 Tag\n\nJump into the action and experience fast-paced tag gameplay. Chase other players through t"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monkaro-privacy-policy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Monkaro Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monkaro/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1310317722167237"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1297610915628406"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1297610915628406"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1790035200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1297610915628406"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1343731855492490", "version": "0.17"}, "id": "1521225110041724", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1246759741856369", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_bina